.TH proc_sys_dev 5 2026\-02\-08 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
/proc/sys/dev/ \- device\-specific information
.SH 説明
.TP 
\fI/proc/sys/dev/\fP
This directory contains device\-specific information (e.g.,
\fIdev/cdrom/info\fP).  On some systems, it may be empty.
.SH 関連項目
\fBproc\fP(5), \fBproc_sys\fP(5)
